    </thead><tbody>
    <tr>
     <td><para unique="1046284">EVEX.LLIG.F3.MAP5.W0 79 /r</para>
      <para unique="1046285">VCVTSH2USI r32, xmm1/m16 {er}</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046287">A</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046292">V/V<footnote><para unique="1046291" format="TableFootnote">Outside of 64b mode, the EVEX.W field is ignored. The instruction behaves as if W=0 was used.</para>
        </footnote></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046294">AVX512_FP16 </para>
      <para unique="1046298">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+157715"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046300">Convert the low FP16 element in xmm1/m16 to an unsigned doubleword integer and store the result in r32.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td><para unique="1046272">EVEX.LLIG.F3.MAP5.W1 79 /r</para>
      <para unique="1046273">VCVTSH2USI r64, xmm1/m16 {er}</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046275">A</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046277">V/N.E.</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046279">AVX512_FP16 </para>
      <para unique="1046280">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+479505"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046282">Convert the low FP16 element in xmm1/m16 to an unsigned quadword integer and store the result in r64.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    </tbody>
   </table>
